  "details": "In sometimes need to confirm if someone is crashing the instance, so I need to \"show\" their avatar. Then I crash. I can't revert this without being in the instance, so I go to the website and block them, then join back to kick them. \nUnfortunately, VRChat loads their avatar FIRST, then checks the block and disables the avatar - enough to freeze my game again. This seems to be a bug, a blocked player's avatar should never load for me.",
